{"kind":"out","n":3,"t":275,"msg":{"id":2,"method":"thread/start","params":{"cwd":"<root>/project","historyMode":"paginated","dynamicTools":[{"type":"function","name":"ask","description":"Use this tool instead of the question tool, and wherever instructions say the question tool. Ask the user questions and wait for the answers. Prefer this over guessing whenever a choice is the user's to make. The user sees only your written replies and this call, never your thinking: when a question asks them to confirm a summary or plan, write it out in your reply before calling. `questions`: one or more pages, each a question with a short `header` and 2–4 options (`label`, optional `description` only when the label needs it). Put the recommended option first and end its label with \"(Recommended)\". Set `multiSelect` when several answers can be true. An option may carry `image`, a PNG, JPG or SVG file path, shown beside the list: use it when a picture explains the option better than words. Set `gallery: true` on a page to show 2–4 designs side by side when the choice is between visual directions; every option then needs an image. `matrix` instead of `questions`: several short propositions answered on one shared scale (2–4 steps, ending in an uncertainty step such as \"Unsure\"); ask the rows answered with it again later, one by one. The user can always type their own answer and add a note.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"questions":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"items":{"type":"object","required":["question","header","options"],"properties":{"question":{"type":"string"},"header":{"type":"string","description":"A short label for the page bar."},"multiSelect":{"type":"boolean"},"gallery":{"type":"boolean"},"options":{"type":"array","minItems":2,"maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"object","required":["label"],"properties":{"label":{"type":"string"},"description":{"type":"string"},"image":{"type":"string","description":"Path of a PNG, JPG or SVG file, absolute or relative to the project."}}}}}}},"matrix":{"type":"object","required":["question","header","rows","scale"],"properties":{"question":{"type":"string"},"header":{"type":"string"},"rows":{"type":"array","minItems":2,"items":{"type":"object","required":["label"],"properties":{"label":{"type":"string"}}}},"scale":{"type":"array","minItems":2,"maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}],"approvalPolicy":"on-request","sandbox":"read-only"}}}
